392 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 269 0 R
/E (The system takes old voice recordings, new voice recordings, and the text that needs to be spoken. It then generates clear and natural speech that sounds like the original voice, even when the speaker is no longer able to speak clearly. The generated speech should also sound smooth and natural, even for long sentences, without sounding robotic or broken. The system will be tested based on how closely the generated voice matches the original voice, how clearly and correctly the words are spoken, and how well the original voice is preserved even as the speech condition gets worse over time.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
